						"description": "Retrieve metadata for a specific file.\n\n### Path Parameters\n\n- `id`: Google Drive file ID\n\n### Response\n\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"1abc123xyz\",\n    \"name\": \"my-image.jpg\",\n    \"size\": \"524288\",\n    \"mimeType\": \"image/jpeg\",\n    \"rawUrl\": \"https://your-worker.workers.dev/files/1abc123xyz\"\n  }\n}\n```"
					},
