						"description": "Delete a file from Google Drive.\n\n### Path Parameters\n\n- `id`: Google Drive file ID\n\n### Response\n\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"1abc123xyz\",\n    \"deleted\": true\n  }\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": [
